    "name": "Timerift Raiders: The Past Awakens",
    "steam_appid": 3042000,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dragons don\u2019t stand a chance against a rocket launcher.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Think <i>D&amp;D meets Call of Duty</i>. Or what if a Navy SEAL dropped into <i>Middle-earth</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter <i>Timerift Raiders</i>\u2014a fast-paced, single-player FPS where modern firepower crashes headfirst into medieval fantasy. Storm castles, slay orcs, and light up dragons with high-tech weaponry as you tear through ancient worlds in a mission that defies time itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042000/extras/23eb77aac4973368917d540c8daeecd9.poster.avif?t=1752855575\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042000/extras/23eb77aac4973368917d540c8daeecd9.webm?t=1752855575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042000/extras/23eb77aac4973368917d540c8daeecd9.mp4?t=1752855575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast Through the Ages</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget swords\u2014you\u2019re packing smart rifles, grenade launchers, and time-bending gear. Outgun spellcasting wizards, dodge dragonfire, and detonate ancient strongholds with a grin. Every fight is a cinematic showstopper.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medieval Chaos, Modern Mayhem</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From war-torn castles to cursed crypts, you\u2019ll raid, blast, and obliterate your way through living legends. Skeleton kings. Elemental golems. Necromancer armies. Your enemies are ancient. Your tactics aren\u2019t.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Story That Hits Hard</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re Ethan Walker\u2014a special ops agent hurled into the past. You didn\u2019t ask to fall in love with a woman from another time. Or become a fugitive hunted by your own agency. But fate has other plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission? Rewrite history... or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042000/extras/fc937f6fefac8b9d0c6586a62de432ae.poster.avif?t=1752855575\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042000/extras/fc937f6fefac8b9d0c6586a62de432ae.webm?t=1752855575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042000/extras/fc937f6fefac8b9d0c6586a62de432ae.mp4?t=1752855575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced FPS combat</strong> with fluid gunplay and brutal takedowns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic boss fights</strong> against dragons, corrupted warlords, and magical monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic, choice-driven story</strong> with twists, romance, and betrayal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon raids &amp; castle sieges</strong> packed with loot, traps, and intense encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart weapon upgrades</strong> \u2013 customize damage, mag size, or ammo for your playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A final choice that changes everything</strong> \u2013 stay in the past, or escape to the future</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042000/extras/0e7afe9442437d74c7b78f1610edca0e.poster.avif?t=1752855575\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042000/extras/0e7afe9442437d74c7b78f1610edca0e.webm?t=1752855575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042000/extras/0e7afe9442437d74c7b78f1610edca0e.mp4?t=1752855575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Built for Bragging Rights</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clip your dragon kills. Show off your perfect boss run. Every moment is highlight-reel worthy-\u00a0<strong>and your timeline is watching.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the past. Locked. Loaded. Unleashed.</strong> </p>",
